 "source_instruction": "i need a vanity light with four bulbs and glass shades.",
 "query": "I swear my cat has been on a total chaos kick this entire week, and I\u2019m still finding little bits of evidence of his mischief every time I turn around. Two nights ago he figured out how to bat the cap off my half-empty bottle of lavender bubble bath while I was grabbing a towel post-shower, and he spilled a good third of it straight into the grout lines between my bathroom tiles. I spent almost an hour on my knees scrubbing suds out of the cracks before they dried sticky, and he just sat on the sink edge the whole time kneading my folded washcloth like he was proud of the extra work he made for me. Yesterday he even stole the fuzzy pom-pom off the end of my favorite house slipper and batted it all the way down the hall into the kitchen, where I found it bobbing in my dog\u2019s water bowl when I went to make my morning coffee.\nHey, I\u2019m browsing the vanities section right now and need a new vanity light for my bathroom reno, I\u2019d really like one with a frosted ceramic shade since that feels warm and matches my tile. Can you point me to options that come in the light build? I don\u2019t want to go too overboard on cost, so just show me ones that are reasonably priced for what they are, yeah? I\u2019m trying to wrap this up quick so I can move on to picking out faucet hardware next.",
